# 02:45 knob search exhausted on held-out rows (qwen L12a6 200 rows +0.5, gemma L18a2 170 rows +0.5 CHAIR_s); last resort (user-approved):
# 'restore' = Eq. steer with alpha -> alpha_t = clip(kappa m0/|d_t| - 1, 0, cap), m0 = mean |d| over caption steps 1..16 (no anchor; current d_t).
